  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the broiler to 400 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "Thread the beef, onion, and bell pepper onto skewers.",
    "In a small bowl, mix together the garlic, olive oil, salt, black pepper, and yeast.",
    "Brush the garlic yeast mixture onto the skewers.",
    "Broil the skewers for 10 minutes per side, or until the beef is cooked to 145 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "Let the skewers rest for 5 minutes before serving.",
    "Serve the skewers hot, with a squeeze of lemon juice.",
    " Garnish with fresh parsley or cilantro, if desired."
